{"id":"fe2a1a65e1939ac6","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-equationrelaxation.md","title":"Relaxation schemes for zero equations","display":"df-equationrelaxation — Relaxation schemes for zero equations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-equationrelaxation","aliases":["27-df-equationrelaxation"],"display":"df-equationrelaxation — Relaxation schemes for zero equations","depends_on":[],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§2.5.2 Relaxation schemes","source_printed_pages":"86,87","source_pdf_pages":"110,111","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-equationrelaxation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-equationrelaxation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-equationrelaxation — Relaxation schemes for zero equations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.5.2 Relaxation schemes"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"86,87"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"110,111"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。把输入写为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\">\\((a,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\)</span>。 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroRelax}(g,f)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZeroRelax}(g,f)\\)</span> 是下节定义的松弛谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroRelax}(g,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\left[\\left(\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(a)=0\\right)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\exists(a,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\;g(a,y)=0\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ZeroRelax}(g,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\left[\\left(\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(a)=0\\right)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\exists(a,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\;g(a,y)=0\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\forall(a,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\;g(a,y)\\le f(a)\\right)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{ZeroRelax}(g,f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\forall(a,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\;g(a,y)\\le f(a)\\right)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{ZeroRelax}(g,f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZeroRelax}(g,f)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\left(\\forall(a,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\;g(a,y)=1\\right)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(a)=1\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ZeroRelax}(g,f)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\left(\\forall(a,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\;g(a,y)=1\\right)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(a)=1\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>松弛方程不一致便能证明原方程不一致；反向推理不成立。逐点下界 g≤f 是一个充分构造方式，例如从 DNF 删除项直至只剩 Horn 项或二次项。若松弛有解，投影后的 a 仍须回代 f 检验，不能把松弛解自动当成原解。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"(a,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZeroRelax}(g,f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZeroRelax}(g,f)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\left[\\left(\\exists a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(a)=0\\right)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\exists(a,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\;g(a,y)=0\\right)\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(\\forall(a,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\;g(a,y)\\le f(a)\\right)\\Rightarrow\\mathrm{ZeroRelax}(g,f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZeroRelax}(g,f)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\left(\\forall(a,y)\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\times\\{0,1\\}^m\\;g(a,y)=1\\right)\\Rightarrow\\left(\\forall a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\;f(a)=1\\right)\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1895,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-equationrelaxation|df-equationrelaxation — Relaxation schemes for zero equations]]"}],"outgoing":[]}